  image_edit
  Edit an existing image using a text prompt. Requires --input <path> for the source image. Optional --mask <path> to limit edits to a region.

  Flags:
    --input <path>     Input file
    --mask <path>      Optional mask image
    --output <path>    Save output to file
    --timeout <secs>   HTTP timeout (default: 60s)

  Arguments (--key value):
    --prompt                   description of the desired edits (required)
    --size                     output dimensions, e.g. "1024x1024" (optional)
    --quality                  "low", "medium", or "high" (optional)

  Example:
  future tools call image_edit --input <file> --prompt "Convert to watercolor painting"
